The file patches the real Go source of math/rand/v2/rand.go.

The real file reads runtime.rand through a go:linkname directive, and that
function holds no body. The top-level functions read it, and Go seeds that
generator with a random value of the operating system. This file seeds a
ChaCha8 with the clock instead. No program can depend on the values of either
generator, thus the meaning stays equal.

